      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 292,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 243,
      "text": "• The ball carries the last flipper’s item until the other flipper hits it.\n• Items stay until replaced or a drain; the ward breaks when it saves.\n• Kinds: damage, elements, gold, control. Doubles don’t stack.\n• The only passive is the amulet holding your lives.\n• Prototype: iron sword, fire staff, coin purse, guardian ward.",
